{
  "slug": "agentic-guardrails",
  "name": "Agentic Guardrails",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A set of strict, senior-level engineering guardrails and security standards for AI coding agents.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill** and **4 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `engineering-standards` (Activate when writing, reviewing, or refactoring any backend or frontend code)\n- **Commands** (4): `cleanup` (Run a rapid code cleanup pass strictly on files changed in the current branch), `review` (Run a comprehensive code review on uncommitted changes), `security-scan` (Run a comprehensive security and vulnerability scan on the current directory), `sweep` (Run a deep-dive code cleanup and refactoring pass on the entire current directory)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install agentic-guardrails@claude-community` from `l-filice89/agentic-guardrails`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
